      "start_seconds": 268.5,
      "end_seconds": 302.95,
      "duration_seconds": 34.45,
      "text": "So based on the history and the examination I'd lean towards possible giant cell arteritis threatening sight. I want to be honest that this is an impression not a final answer. I'm sending you for urgent blood tests because of possible giant cell arteritis. I'm going to put you on prednisolone 60 milligrams once a day until review. That's for possible giant cell arteritis. I'll put all of this in writing so you don't have to remember it."
