      "start_seconds": 303.68,
      "end_seconds": 320.75,
      "duration_seconds": 17.07,
      "text": "start the steroid today this is to protect your sight cut down on salt and fried food for now it really does make a difference please don't wait if you lose vision that's when to be seen urgently i'd like you back tomorrow"
    },
